  DisplayName: An Alpine Monastery Is Dissolved
  EventType: 1
  Description: The government {has dissolved|is set to dissolve} an old monastery
    in the Tyrol, and its library and chapel {are going|will go} under the hammer.
    Early books and carved saints {come|will come} to market in a single week, more
    than the trade can take at once.
